=== entitlements with the operator key
GET /api/admin/entitlements as operator key
status: 200
Cache-Control: no-store
Content-Type: application/json
body (json, newline):
{
  "caps": {},
  "features": [
    "gadgets",
    "widgets"
  ],
  "license_module": false,
  "plan": "free",
  "state": "free",
  "tenant_quota": 0,
  "withheld": []
}

=== entitlements with no credential
GET /api/admin/entitlements
status: 401
Cache-Control: no-store
Content-Type: application/json
body (json, newline):
{
  "code": "unauthorized",
  "error": "authentication required",
  "request_id": "<request-id>"
}

=== plugin status with the operator key
GET /api/admin/plugins/status as operator key
status: 200
Cache-Control: no-store
Content-Type: application/json
body (json, newline):
{
  "compiled": [
    "gadgets",
    "widgets"
  ],
  "entitled": [
    "gadgets",
    "widgets"
  ],
  "plugins": [
    {
      "active": true,
      "compiled": true,
      "entitled": true,
      "name": "gadgets",
      "phase": "running",
      "requested": true,
      "routes": [
        {
          "group": "admin",
          "method": "GET",
          "pattern": "/api/admin/wire/gadgets"
        }
      ],
      "started_at": "<time>"
    },
    {
      "active": true,
      "compiled": true,
      "entitled": true,
      "name": "widgets",
      "phase": "running",
      "requested": true,
      "routes": [
        {
          "group": "admin",
          "method": "GET",
          "pattern": "/api/admin/wire/widgets"
        }
      ],
      "started_at": "<time>"
    }
  ]
}

=== running plugins with the operator key
GET /api/admin/plugins/running as operator key
status: 200
Cache-Control: no-store
Content-Type: application/json
body (json, newline):
{
  "plugins": [
    "gadgets",
    "widgets"
  ],
  "withheld": []
}

=== renew with the operator key
POST /api/admin/license/renew as operator key
status: 404
Cache-Control: no-store
Content-Type: application/json
body (json, newline):
{
  "code": "not_found",
  "error": "The requested endpoint does not exist.",
  "request_id": "<request-id>"
}

=== tenant features with the operator key
GET /api/admin/tenant-features/default as operator key
status: 404
Cache-Control: no-store
Content-Type: application/json
body (json, newline):
{
  "code": "not_found",
  "error": "The requested endpoint does not exist.",
  "request_id": "<request-id>"
}

=== an ungated plugin's route
GET /api/admin/wire/widgets as operator key
status: 200
Cache-Control: no-store
Content-Type: application/json
body (json, newline):
{
  "plugin": "widgets",
  "tenant": "default"
}

=== a gated plugin's route
GET /api/admin/wire/gadgets as operator key
status: 200
Cache-Control: no-store
Content-Type: application/json
body (json, newline):
{
  "plugin": "gadgets",
  "tenant": "default"
}

